;; Bill's training stage (0.4.38, src/game/tutorial/heroes/bill.ts; docs/HEROES.md), in the Contra
;; jungle look: the rifle at an enemy (gate 16), aiming up and up-ahead at two high targets (gate
;; 34), prone under a turret's shots (gate 45), a shot down at the enemy in the ditch from a jump
;; (gate 56), the Medal and the Machine Gun held on a group of enemies (gate 75), a note on switching
;; guns, the Laser through two targets in a row (gate 93), the Flame Gun at a tough target (gate
;; 105), the Spread Gun's fan at three targets at once (gate 121) and the flagpole. Each power
;; block's item is in [hero-items]; the gates are laid by the tutorial.
